{"id": "27209", "title": "牛天赐传", "author": "老舍", "category": "文学名著", "count": 24, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/27/27209.htm", "intro": "老舍笔下的人物性格鲜明，细节真实，再加之语言讽刺幽默，诙谐轻松，作品深受人民喜爱。为纪念老舍诞辰110周年，隆重推出《老舍小说精汇》。《牛天赐传》(精装)为系列之一，收录的是长篇小说《牛天赐传》。小说写一对牛姓夫妇收养了一个在其门口被发现的小孩子，这个孩子是老天爷给的，就叫牛天赐。天赐什么都不会做，养父母一死，他就玩完了。怎么办…", "base": "files/article/html/27/27209", "chapters": [{"title": "一　天官赐福", "file": "1835790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二　歪打正着", "file": "1835792.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三　子孙万代", "file": "1835793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四　钩儿套圈", "file": "1835794.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五　解放时期", "file": "1835798.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六　哗啷棒儿", "file": "1835801.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七　两种生活", "file": "1835802.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八　男女分座", "file": "1835805.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九　换毛的鸡", "file": "1835807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十　开市大吉", "file": "1835809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一　没有面子", "file": "1835811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二　教育专家", "file": "1835814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三　领文凭去", "file": "1835817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四　桃园结义", "file": "1835819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五　天罗地网", "file": "1835821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六　一命身亡", "file": "1835822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七　到乡间去", "file": "1835823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八　月牙太太", "file": "1835826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九　诗人商人", "file": "1835829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十　红半个天", "file": "1835832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十一　人面桃花", "file": "1835835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十二　家败人亡", "file": "1835840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十三　隐士卖梨", "file": "1835843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十四　狗长犄角", "file": "1835846.html", "available": false}]}